# Line endings are part of the contract, not a per-machine preference.
#
# This repo had `core.autocrlf=true` and no attributes file, so Git rewrote LF to
# CRLF on checkout. That is invisible until something reads a file literally: the
# storage-RLS test asserts on exact SQL substrings (`"public.has_permission(...)\n"`),
# so a CRLF checkout made the mutation silently match nothing and the guard
# reported a content failure that had nothing to do with content.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` makes the working tree identical on Windows, macOS and Linux
# and in CI, so a green suite here means the same thing there.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated artefacts that must never be diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary